-- Typed production + depth for the eight pre-existing A2.2 grammar topics (Course Factory Wave 5, PR A2).
--
-- What: EXTEND-mode additions to reflexive-verbs, simple-past-sein-haben, coordinating-conjunctions,
-- subordinating-conjunctions, subordinate-word-order, comparative, superlative and future-tense:
-- +10 typed production exercises each (options NULL + acceptable_answers, 80 in total, continuing each
-- topic's global exercise order_index), plus +3 rules and +4 examples for the six 5-6-rule topics
-- (18 rules, 24 examples). No topic INSERTs, no CHECK change.
-- Why: before this migration every A2.2 topic 1-8 had 0 typed exercises (multiple choice only), so a
-- learner could pass the level without producing a single German sentence; mirrors #75 (A1) and #83
-- (A2.1). Content passed an adversarial German review (two to three rounds per author set).
--
-- Grammar content migration generated by scripts/grammar-topics-from-json.mjs on 2026-09-06T15:18:02.426Z.
--
-- Extends 8 existing grammar topic(s):
--   - comparative (A2.2): +3 rule(s), +4 example(s), +10 exercise(s)
--   - coordinating-conjunctions (A2.2): +3 rule(s), +4 example(s), +10 exercise(s)
--   - future-tense (A2.2): +3 rule(s), +4 example(s), +10 exercise(s)
--   - reflexive-verbs (A2.2): +3 rule(s), +4 example(s), +10 exercise(s)
--   - simple-past-sein-haben (A2.2): +3 rule(s), +4 example(s), +10 exercise(s)
